      * I-RLU sample printer file - customer invoice

                                            PAGSIZE(66 132) PRTQLTY(*STD)
                R HEADER                    SKIPB(1)
                  CUSTNAME      30A  B  1 10
        50        CUSTNBR        7S 0B  1 50DRAW
                                        5 10'Invoice Date:' SPACEB(1)
                  INVDATE        8A  O  5 25SPACEA(2)
                R DETAIL                    OVERFLOW(60)
                  ITEMDESC      20A  O  1 10
                  ITEMQTY        5S 0O  1 32
                  ITEMAMT        9S 2O  1 40EDTCDE(J)
                R FOOTER                    SKIPB(2)
                                        1  5'Page'
                                        1 12PAGNBR
